{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Department for Work and Pensions","tree_line_end":6,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF LEGAL GROUP)","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":7},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":21,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 11 ","tree_line_end":25,"tree_line_start":22},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 39 – June 2017 ","tree_line_end":29,"tree_line_start":26},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":33,"tree_line_start":30},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":37,"tree_line_start":34},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1.This letter provides details on Amendment 39; the changes have already beenincorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":38},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":48,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2.PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with theamended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain theamendment number in the footer","tree_line_end":54,"tree_line_start":49},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":59,"tree_line_start":55},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at:","tree_line_end":64,"tree_line_start":60},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":69,"tree_line_start":65},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n","tree_line_end":81,"tree_line_start":70},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":86,"tree_line_start":82},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link:","tree_line_end":90,"tree_line_start":87},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":91},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://www.dwp.gov.uk/publications/specialist-guides/decision-makers-guide/\n","tree_line_end":106,"tree_line_start":95},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":111,"tree_line_start":107},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: When printing PDF packages set the print properties to Duplex/LongEdge in order to produce double sided prints.","tree_line_end":116,"tree_line_start":112},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":121,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"3.Amendment 39 affects chapter 67.  The changes","tree_line_end":127,"tree_line_start":122},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":130,"tree_line_start":128},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"•incorporate DMG memo 4/17\n•make minor and consequential changes","tree_line_end":143,"tree_line_start":131},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"•incorporate DMG memo 4/17","tree_line_end":137,"tree_line_start":132},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"•make minor and consequential changes","tree_line_end":143,"tree_line_start":138},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":146,"tree_line_start":144},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"4.The last two amendment packages amending Volume 11 were","tree_line_end":150,"tree_line_start":147},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":155,"tree_line_start":151},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 38 [June 2015]","tree_line_end":160,"tree_line_start":156},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":165,"tree_line_start":161},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 37 [February 2015]","tree_line_end":170,"tree_line_start":166},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":175,"tree_line_start":171},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":180,"tree_line_start":176},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"5.For reference purposes Decision Makers may find it useful to retaindeleted pages for a short period after the introduction of this package.","tree_line_end":185,"tree_